OL,3,ADetails of thousands of US immigration
OL,4,Aagents leaked in major hack
OL,5,
OL,6,FDetails of more than 41,000 personnel
OL,7,Fworking for the US Department of
OL,8,FHomeland Security (DHS), including
OL,9,Fthousands involved in immigration
OL,10,Fenforcement, have been leaked to the
OL,11,Fpublic.
OL,13,FThe leak includes names, work
OL,14,Faddresses, and phone numbers of DHS
OL,15,Fstaff, including agents working with
OL,16,FImmigration and Customs Enforcement and
OL,17,FCustoms and Border Protection, along
OL,18,Fwith descriptions of the work that they
OL,19,Fdo for each agency.
